+    /// The arrow key and the number of presses for steps of the wheel, as xterm, Ghostty and
+    /// kitty do over a program on the whole screen that does not take the mouse. Rex drops the
+    /// wheel there. A wheel notch sends three presses, as a program that takes the mouse
